The '''Critterdex''' is a menu that documents the player's uniquely captured {{mt|Critter}}[[Critters|{{Gamefont|{{Green|s}}}}]] in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== UI ==
{{/UI}}

== Overview ==
=== Unlocking ===
The player can unlock the '''Critterdex''' from {{NPCSprite|"Hunter" Tobias}}. After Tobias denies the correlation of his father's ownership to his success, the player can either unlock the '''Critterdex''' by selecting {{Green|[Nice!]}} or by replying with "sorry" after selecting {{Red|[Suuuuuure...]}}.

=== Rewards ===
The player gains rewards for catching a critter for the first time, the rewards scale by the rarity of the critter. Critters captured by others and lootshared will not unlock the corresponding entry.

