=== Sparkling Critterdex ===
{{Main|Critter Safari#Sparkling Critters}}
Upon capturing all {{Green|37}} [[Critters]] on the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}, the player unlocks the '''Sparkling Critterdex''', which tracks how many unique {{Gold|'''Sparkling'''}} Critters the player has captured. Capturing {{Gold|'''Sparkling'''}} Critters contributes to the player's '''Sparkling Milestones'''. Unlike the normal '''Critterdex''', captures by other players will unlock the corresponding entries.

